- Niels, I don't read books,
because of a couple things.

00:01:59.026 --> 00:02:02.045
One, I'm very inefficient at reading

00:02:02.045 --> 00:02:04.181
so it takes me a long, long time,

00:02:04.181 --> 00:02:06.991
and the truth is I don't
think I actually grasp

00:02:06.991 --> 00:02:07.919
