last six to eight months

00:02:10.514 --> 00:02:11.792
here at VaynerMedia.

00:02:11.792 --> 00:02:13.487
When I see that something
comes in my inbox

00:02:13.487 --> 00:02:16.250
that's a very important piece of business,

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:19.362
and it's a very long email,
AKA more than 18 words,

00:02:19.362 --> 00:02:21.753
I call a five minute meeting,
because in five minutes,

00:02:21.753 --> 00:02:23.030
and my staff will tell you.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:24.702
You won't see the body language here,

00:02:24.702 --> 00:02:25.979
but I'm saying it for them

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.117
it's insane.

00:02:27.117 --> 00:02:29.346
In a meeting, I basically don't even let

00:02:29.346 --> 00:02:30.971
people finish saying what they're saying,

00:02:30.971 --> 00:02:32.945
because I've grasped it,
but if they sent me that

00:02:32.945 --> 00:02:35.429
same comment in four sentences

00:02:35.429 --> 00:02:37.496
I literally wouldn't even
know what was going on.

00:02:37.496 --> 00:02:40.932
I don't read, because I
don't think it's an efficient

00:02:40.932 --> 00:02:44.508
transaction of transforming information

00:02:44.508 --> 00:02:46.412
